{{!
    @template local_llmchat/message_assistant

    One assistant turn: a body the client streams into in order — thinking blocks, groups of
    tool cards, text segments, interactions, footer — always above the working indicator, which
    shows whenever the model works with nothing streaming.

    With an empty context it is the shell of a live turn. The page renders the finished turns of
    a stored conversation with "done" (no working indicator) and "parts", the body in stream
    order: a text segment ("istext", answer HTML), a group of tool cards ("istools", their HTML)
    or other HTML ("ishtml": a thinking block, an answered interaction, the footer, a notice).

    Example context (json):
    {
        "done": true,
        "hasparts": true,
        "parts": [
            {"istext": true, "html": ""},
            {"ishtml": true, "html": "<div class=\"local-llmchat-thinking\">…</div>"},
            {"istools": true, "html": "<div class=\"list-group-item\">Suche „Raum“</div>"},
            {"istext": true, "html": "<p>Der Unterricht ist montags in Raum B204.</p>"}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="local-llmchat-msg local-llmchat-msg-assistant" data-role="assistant">
    <div class="local-llmchat-body local-llmchat-minw0" data-region="body">
        <span class="sr-only visually-hidden">{{#str}} assistant, local_llmchat {{/str}}:</span>
        {{^hasparts}}
        <div class="local-llmchat-text" data-region="text"></div>
        {{/hasparts}}
        {{#parts}}
        {{#istext}}<div class="local-llmchat-text" data-region="text">{{{html}}}</div>{{/istext}}
        {{#istools}}<div class="list-group local-llmchat-tools" data-region="tools">{{{html}}}</div>{{/istools}}
        {{#ishtml}}{{{html}}}{{/ishtml}}
        {{/parts}}
        <div class="local-llmchat-typing{{#done}} d-none{{/done}}" data-region="typing" role="status">
            <span class="spinner-grow spinner-grow-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="spinner-grow spinner-grow-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="spinner-grow spinner-grow-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="sr-only visually-hidden">{{#str}} thinking, local_llmchat {{/str}}</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
